<Step ID="5" Task="Calculate the relative uncertainty in energy ΔU / U = sqrt[ (ΔC_eq / C_eq)^2 + (2 ΔV / V)^2 ] using results from Step 3 and Step 4. What is the value?" Difficulty="4" Token="50" Rely="3,4"/>
