\[
f(\nu) = \int_{\nu}^{1} \frac{dt}{\sqrt{(t^2-\nu^2)(\nu^2-t^2)}}
\]

**Answer:**  
\[ f(\nu) = \int_{\nu}^{1} \frac{dt}{\sqrt{(t^2-\nu^2)(\nu^2-t^2)}} \]

