- Step ID: 2
- Task: Apply the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality to ∫₀ᵃ f(x) dx: ∫₀ᵃ f(x) dx ≤ √(∫₀ᵃ f(x)² dx · ∫₀ᵃ 1 dx) ≤ √(B a), where B = ∫₀∞ f(x)² dx.



