- Conceptual trap: Assuming that H is the whole group without computing the index. The gcd of minors might not be 1, so index is not 1.
- Calculation trap: Incorrectly computing the minors or their gcd. Also, when solving congruences, might make arithmetic errors in modular arithmetic.
